# NOTE: drafts/ is deliberately NOT ignored. A record and its research log
# before promotion are part of the audit trail - AGENT_WORKFLOW.md section 2
# cites the research log as a deliverable of the RESEARCH stage.

# NOTE: results/ is deliberately NOT ignored.
# Test output is evidence in this project, not build waste. The whole point of
# PREDICTIONS.md is that a reader can check predictions against what actually
# came out of the simulator, so the outputs are committed alongside the
# predictions that anticipated them.
